    "title": "Remains found in Marion County identified as man who went missing in 2024 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WTVC ,\n5 hours ago MARION COUNTY, Tenn. — Human remains found in Marion County last month have been identified as a man who was reported missing in 2024, according to the Marion County Sheriff’s Office. The Marion County Sheriff’s Office was notified Sept. 16th of possible human remains discovered near Pryor Ridge... Read full article\n2",
